        "Description": "Today you&apos;re going back to Haven Island for a very mysterious gig. Today&apos;s main target is named Tyson Williams. I don&apos;t know much about his history, but what I do know is that he currently lives in a mansion on Haven Island, with a crazy security system. The other target is his bodyguard named Mike Thompson. I don&apos;t know why our client wants to murder these people, but it doesn&apos;t matter as long as we get paid. Right? Well good luck, and as always... Have fun!",
